abstract: >
An open educational and research initiative exploring embodied,
spatial, and inclusive approaches to musical understanding through
Kalisarmonia, Jacob's Hand, Human Kolintang System, Kolintang Hand,
Directional Chord System, Deaf-led Innovation, and Embodied Music Pedagogy.

